      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "בריאה\/יברא",
      "rationale": "Kĩndũ kĩa kĩmwe-kĩrũ nĩkuo kĩheanwo na kũheanwo kwa Yahwe — kĩugo kĩmwe kĩarahũkĩte, gĩtihoteka mũno thĩinĩ wa Gĩkũyũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "פצתה האדמה את פיה",
      "rationale": "Thĩ 'yagũrũkĩte iroto wayo' — ciugo cia Kĩhibirania nĩ cia kĩũndũ-gĩrũ, no cĩĩhotosrĩtwo ta maũndũ ma nyũmba-njũru."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "חיים שאלה",
      "rationale": "Mĩhang'o makĩtherema Ceori na miyũre — KJV 'kĩgima'; Ceori ti 'kũherithio kwa thutha', nĩ kũndũ kwa arĩa makuũ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na ĩ Yahwe atheĩre kĩndũ kĩa kĩmwe-kĩrũ, na thĩ yagũrũkĩte ⟨את⟩ iroto wayo, iramemera ⟨את⟩ arĩa ao na ⟨את⟩ wona o ũrĩa mmarĩ, makĩtherema kuya Ceori na miyũre, nĩmũkũmenya atĩ andũ arĩa macio o menete ⟨את⟩ Yahwe.",
